K-1.2 independent public bibliography comparison

All remote requests used fixed public URLs or fixed general subject queries, with no input derived from the private research archive. Public metadata was downloaded first; the private archive was read only in a separate offline process. No private strings, identifiers, URLs, or raw hashes are recorded here. The public metadata was not committed.

